+---
+id: task-002-record-task-createdat-and-updatedat
+type: task
+title: "Record task createdAt and updatedAt"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Request
+
+Every task has `createdAt` and `updatedAt`, ISO-8601 date-time strings. They are equal when the task is
+added; every change (complete, reopen, rename, tag, untag) sets `updatedAt` to the time of the change.
+
+## Done
+
+- The domain never reads the clock (r3): `createTaskList` takes a `now` function returning an ISO string;
+  `createTodoList` in `src/index.ts` supplies the real clock and accepts an optional one for tests.
+- Failed changes leave the task untouched.
+- Tests in `test/list.test.ts`; `npm test` passes.
